<!-- V4.4 = V4.2 HDR50-22 pedestal robot (unchanged include) + suction-cup EOAT.

     Built only from official open-source Gazebo (gz-sim 6 / Fortress) systems
     because no maintained vacuum-gripper plugin exists for Fortress
     (gazebo_ros_vacuum_gripper is Gazebo Classic only)
       - suction cup link with collision geometry on the flange
       - contact sensor (+ Contact system in ahead_workcell_v4_4_suction.sdf)
       - TouchPlugin                       -> /pac/suction/touched when the cup
                                              touches the box continuously
       - DetachableJoint                   -> fixed joint cup-box on attach
     The vacuum on/off logic is scripts/suction_gripper_node.py.
     Cup geometry is a placeholder (EOAT not selected yet). -->
